# UI & Design System Rules
- Always wrap main layouts in a centered container: `max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`.
- Build UI using clean Grid/Flexbox with explicit gaps (e.g., `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8`).
- Never leave absolute-positioned elements uncentered or overlapping.
- Follow Modern Minimalist Aesthetic:
  - Generous whitespace/padding (`p-6`, `py-12`).
  - Subtle borders (`border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800`).
  - Glassmorphism & Soft shadows (`bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm`).
  - Rounded corners (`rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for buttons).
- Typography: Strict hierarchy using Tailwind text sizes (`text-3xl font-bold`, `text-sm text-slate-500`).
